Dialogue: 0,0:00:01.20,0:00:03.34,TL,,0,0,237,,{\an2}{\fnInter 24pt SemiBold\b0\fs44\bord2.5\fsp0.6}…in business, in Beijing.{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC\b1\fs68\bord4\fsp0}\N……在北京重回胜利轨道
Dialogue: 0,0:00:03.50,0:00:05.59,TL,,0,0,237,,{\an2}{\fnInter 24pt SemiBold\b0\fs44\bord2.5\fsp0.6}Score: 6–3, 7–6{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC\b1\fs68\bord4\fsp0}\N比分：{\fs78}6{\fs68}比{\fs78}3{\fs68}、{\fs78}7{\fs68}比{\fs78}6{\fs68}
Dialogue: 0,0:00:05.70,0:00:09.16,TL,,0,0,237,,{\an2}{\fs78}11{\fs68}年后重返中网 德约还是没输
Dialogue: 0,0:00:09.16,0:00:10.91,TL,,0,0,237,,{\an2}但这第{\fs78}30{\fs68}场胜利
Dialogue: 0,0:00:10.91,0:00:13.34,TL,,0,0,237,,{\an2}远没有比分看起来轻松
Dialogue: 0,0:00:13.34,0:00:16.92,TL,,0,0,237,,{\an2}北京时间{\fs78}9{\fs68}月{\fs78}30{\fs68}号晚上 中网首轮
Dialogue: 0,0:00:16.92,0:00:20.03,TL,,0,0,237,,{\an2}{\fs78}1{\fs68}比{\fs78}0{\fs68}领先 德约在接发局拿到机会
Dialogue: 0,0:00:20.03,0:00:22.32,TL,,0,0,237,,{\an2}开局就打成了消耗战
Dialogue: 0,0:00:22.32,0:00:25.33,TL,,0,0,237,,{\an2}他要先拿下 这一个接发局
Dialogue: 0,0:00:43.22,0:00:44.92,TL,,0,0,237,,{\an2}{\fnInter 24pt SemiBold\b0\fs44\bord2.5\fsp0.6}That's like he's never been away.{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC\b1\fs68\bord4\fsp0}\N仿佛他从未离开过
Dialogue: 0,0:00:45.22,0:00:46.81,TL,,0,0,237,,{\an2}{\fs78}3{\fs68}比{\fs78}0{\fs68}开局
Dialogue: 0,0:00:46.81,0:00:49.44,TL,,0,0,237,,{\an2}{\fs78}4{\fs68}比{\fs78}2{\fs68}时 两个破发点都救回来
Dialogue: 0,0:00:49.44,0:00:51.50,TL,,0,0,237,,{\an2}德约守到{\fs78}5{\fs68}比{\fs78}2{\fs68}
Dialogue: 0,0:00:52.22,0:00:55.16,TL,,0,0,237,,{\an2}{\fs78}5{\fs68}比{\fs78}3{\fs68} 盘点 发球之后
Dialogue: 0,0:00:55.16,0:00:57.26,TL,,0,0,237,,{\an2}再把这一分收好
Dialogue: 0,0:00:59.08,0:01:01.10,TL,,0,0,237,,{\an2}{\fnInter 24pt SemiBold\b0\fs44\bord2.5\fsp0.6}That's a pretty strong set…{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC\b1\fs68\bord4\fsp0}\N这一盘打得相当出色……
Dialogue: 0,0:01:01.14,0:01:03.02,TL,,0,0,237,,{\an2}{\fs78}6{\fs68}比{\fs78}3{\fs68} 首盘到手
Dialogue: 0,0:01:03.05,0:01:03.70,TL,,0,0,237,,{\an2}{\fnInter 24pt SemiBold\b0\fs44\bord2.5\fsp0.6}…Djokovic.{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC\b1\fs68\bord4\fsp0}\N……德约科维奇
Dialogue: 0,0:01:03.92,0:01:05.31,TL,,0,0,237,,{\an2}第二盘{\fs78}2{\fs68}比{\fs78}3{\fs68}后
Dialogue: 0,0:01:05.31,0:01:07.25,TL,,0,0,237,,{\an2}他接受了场边治疗
Dialogue: 0,0:01:07.25,0:01:10.78,TL,,0,0,237,,{\an2}身体不适 发球局却一个也没丢
Dialogue: 0,0:01:11.52,0:01:14.99,TL,,0,0,237,,{\an2}{\fs78}4{\fs68}比{\fs78}4{\fs68} 德约又想从接发局找到出路
Dialogue: 0,0:01:14.99,0:01:16.93,TL,,0,0,237,,{\an2}可博尔热斯不肯让
Dialogue: 0,0:01:16.93,0:01:20.03,TL,,0,0,237,,{\an2}这一分 从底线一侧拉到另一侧
Dialogue: 0,0:01:20.03,0:01:21.48,TL,,0,0,237,,{\an2}身体已经不舒服
Dialogue: 0,0:01:21.48,0:01:23.32,TL,,0,0,237,,{\an2}回合却还没结束
Dialogue: 0,0:01:23.32,0:01:24.62,TL,,0,0,237,,{\an2}没有容易的胜利
Dialogue: 0,0:01:24.62,0:01:27.28,TL,,0,0,237,,{\an2}就先把眼前这一分拼下来
Dialogue: 0,0:01:47.28,0:01:49.46,TL,,0,0,237,,{\an2}{\fnInter 24pt SemiBold\b0\fs44\bord2.5\fsp0.6}What a way to finish!{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC\b1\fs68\bord4\fsp0}\N这一分收得太精彩了！
Dialogue: 0,0:01:51.24,0:01:52.90,TL,,0,0,237,,{\an2}{\fnInter 24pt SemiBold\b0\fs44\bord2.5\fsp0.6}Who was going to blink first?{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC\b1\fs68\bord4\fsp0}\N看谁会先撑不住？
Dialogue: 0,0:01:53.27,0:01:56.15,TL,,0,0,237,,{\an2}这一分赢了 破发却没能兑现
Dialogue: 0,0:01:56.15,0:01:56.96,TL,,0,0,237,,{\an2}{\fs78}4{\fs68}比{\fs78}5{\fs68}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:56.96,0:01:59.64,TL,,0,0,237,,{\an2}德约还得先守住自己的发球局
Dialogue: 0,0:01:59.64,0:02:01.94,TL,,0,0,237,,{\an2}此后{\fs78}5{\fs68}比{\fs78}6{\fs68} 他又顶住压力
Dialogue: 0,0:02:01.94,0:02:04.28,TL,,0,0,237,,{\an2}把第二盘带进抢七
Dialogue: 0,0:02:08.40,0:02:10.80,TL,,0,0,237,,{\an2}{\fnInter 24pt SemiBold\b0\fs44\bord2.5\fsp0.6}That is great hustle from him.{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC\b1\fs68\bord4\fsp0}\N他这一分拼得真顽强
Dialogue: 0,0:02:11.37,0:02:14.70,TL,,0,0,237,,{\an2}抢七开始 两个人仍然在底线拉锯
Dialogue: 0,0:02:14.70,0:02:16.92,TL,,0,0,237,,{\an2}前面守住的每一个发球局
Dialogue: 0,0:02:16.92,0:02:18.90,TL,,0,0,237,,{\an2}终于把比赛带到了这里
Dialogue: 0,0:02:18.90,0:02:20.70,TL,,0,0,237,,{\an2}德约没有让身体的不适
Dialogue: 0,0:02:20.70,0:02:22.58,TL,,0,0,237,,{\an2}变成比分上的失守
Dialogue: 0,0:02:22.58,0:02:25.84,TL,,0,0,237,,{\an2}这一球 双方还是谁都不肯先退
Dialogue: 0,0:02:47.82,0:02:51.66,TL,,0,0,237,,{\an2}{\fnInter 24pt SemiBold\b0\fs44\bord2.5\fsp0.6}What a point to start a tie-break!{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC\b1\fs68\bord4\fsp0}\N抢七第一分就如此精彩！
Dialogue: 0,0:02:51.97,0:02:55.69,TL,,0,0,237,,{\an2}从{\fs78}5{\fs68}比{\fs78}1{\fs68} 到{\fs78}6{\fs68}比{\fs78}2{\fs68} 赛点
Dialogue: 0,0:03:01.97,0:03:03.91,TL,,0,0,237,,{\an2}{\fs78}6{\fs68}比{\fs78}3{\fs68} {\fs78}7{\fs68}比{\fs78}6{\fs68}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:03.91,0:03:06.10,TL,,0,0,237,,{\an2}{\fs78}11{\fs68}年过去 重返中网
Dialogue: 0,0:03:06.10,0:03:08.63,TL,,0,0,237,,{\an2}他把纪录续到{\fs78}30{\fs68}战全胜
Dialogue: 0,0:03:08.63,0:03:09.62,TL,,0,0,237,,{\an2}掌声还在
Dialogue: 0,0:03:09.62,0:03:12.37,TL,,0,0,237,,{\an2}德约的北京故事也还在继续
Dialogue: 0,0:03:12.37,0:03:14.50,TL,,0,0,237,,{\an2}下一轮迎战布云朝克特
Dialogue: 0,0:03:14.50,0:03:16.58,TL,,0,0,237,,{\an2}他能在这里继续赢下去吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:03:16.60,0:03:18.10,TL,,0,0,237,,{\an2}{\fnInter 24pt SemiBold\b0\fs44\bord2.5\fsp0.6}…it's like he's never been away.{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC\b1\fs68\bord4\fsp0}\N……仿佛他从未离开过
Dialogue: 0,0:03:19.20,0:03:22.43,TL,,0,0,237,,{\an2}{\fnInter 24pt SemiBold\b0\fs44\bord2.5\fsp0.6}He maintains his perfect record here.{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC\b1\fs68\bord4\fsp0}\N他继续保持着在这里的全胜纪录
